Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光是想起来就害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It scares us just thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是听了这个故事 你肯定会觉得我们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hear it, you're gonna think we 're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看吧 麻烦从头开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try us. Please, from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始只是小动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It started out small,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如手啊 腿啊 与先前的位置不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a hand or a leg was in a different position.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.15,0:00:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后它的头不是向下看 而是向上看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then its head was looking up instead of down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着有一天 它突然出现在另一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one day, it was in a completely different room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能四处活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was moving around by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有可能是有你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever think maybe somebody had a key
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公寓钥匙的人的恶作剧呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your apartment and was playing a trick on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以前也是这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(安娜贝拉案件 1968年)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们从没发现有人进来过的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But never once did we find any sign or evidence of intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们都认为这个娃娃被鬼怪附体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this all led you to believe that the doll was possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:00:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.55,0:01:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前 Camilla 联系过一个灵媒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camilla got in touch with a medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说有一个七岁小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We learned from her that a 7 year old girl..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫 Annabelle Higgins 死在这公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Named Annabelle Higgins had died in this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很孤单 也很喜欢我的娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was lonely and took a liking to my doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只是想和我们做朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All she wanted was to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们听了之后 很同情她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we heard this, we felt really sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说 我们是护士 就应该帮助他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we're nurses, we help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So..
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就同意她附身在这个娃娃上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..We gave her permission to move into the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 你们做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想通过附身在这娃娃上 和我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wanted to live with us by inhabiting the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 从那时起 情况变得糟糕起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then things got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家时 她就坐在走廊上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we came home, she was sitting in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们把她放在客房的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we had left her in the spare room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Debbie Debbie 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debbie! Debbie, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们吓蒙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are beyond terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道这是怎么了 也不知道该怎么做 你们能帮我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what's going on or what to do. Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 首先 根本没有个叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, firstly, there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Annabelle的女孩 也从未存在过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}such thing as Annabelle, and there never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼怪也没有这样的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghosts don't possess such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这东西有极强的操纵能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think what we have here is something extremely manipulative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非人类的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们承认这个娃娃的身份是个大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a big mistake acknowledging this doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此 你们才会被这鬼神怪力作弄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And through that, the inhuman spirit tricked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们默许了它侵扰你们的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it permission to infest your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这鬼神怪力是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's an inhuman spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不会以人类的形式存在在地球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something that's never walked the earth in human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是恶魔的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something demonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 娃娃没有被附体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the doll was never possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 它只是一个媒介\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it was used as a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它出现在各处 造成一种被附体的假象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was moved around to give the impression of possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔只附体于人 而非物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demonic spirits don't possess things, they possess people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们 才是它的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wanted to get inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 可以了 Drew 关了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's good, Drew. You can shut it down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们让教堂派了一位牧师去赐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we got the church to send a priest over perform
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于这间房子和它的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bless the house and the occupants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管之前是什么在侵扰这间公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever was oppressing that apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已离他们远去 有什么问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was no longer with them. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那娃娃现在在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the doll now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这位 - 你们到底是干什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yep. - So, what are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说人们怎么称呼你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what do people call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛 有人叫过我们鬼神学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, well, we've been called Demonologists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是其中一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one name for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捉鬼人 超自然研究者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghost hunters, paranormal researchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇葩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wackos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是更喜欢人们叫我们Ed和Lorraine Warren\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we prefer to be known simply as Ed and Lorraine Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十世纪60年代起 Ed和Lorraine Warren就被奉为世界上最富盛名的超自然研究者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lorraine天生拥有敏锐的洞察力而Ed只是一名被天主教堂承认的未受戒的鬼神学家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贯穿他们饱受争议的职业生涯的几千起案件中有这么一起如此恶意满满致使他们保密至今
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基于真实故事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《招魂》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1971年 哈利斯维尔 罗德岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么都没有听到 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't hear anything. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.91,0:06:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 小家伙们 我们到了 - 从车里出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Guys, we are here! - Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 这里真是偏僻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, we're in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:07:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们兴奋吗  - 快回答是 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you excited? - Where's my "Yes"? Where's my "Yes"? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来赛跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll race you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们不兴奋吗 - 兴奋啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you guys excited? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好兴奋 来啊 Sadie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so excited! Come on, Sadie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要有自己的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get my own room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:11.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了 不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? No dibs on the rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能自己选房间吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I get to pick my own room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是连这我也没有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do I have no choice in that either?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要遇到一个小帅哥 她就会忘了Jersey\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, first cute boy she meets, she'll forget about Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 Sadie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sadie 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadie, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走啊 姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你就待着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:49.11,3,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借过借过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, watch out, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这个你想放哪儿 - 放客厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do you want it? - They go to the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Andrea 我的风铃呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrea, where's my wind chime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nancy大概放那房间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Nancy's got it in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 Nancy 你看到我的风铃了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. Hey, Nancy, have you seen my wind chime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这个吗 - 对 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, this one? - Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得够得着 - Nancy 放手 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna have to catch it. - Nancy! Let go! Give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我能把风铃挂起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mom, can I hang up my wind chime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 外面有条绳儿 你挂那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. There's a line outside you can hang it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 让April进来 天都要黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, have April come in, okay? It's gonna be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.19,0:08:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 April 妈妈让我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, April! Mom wants us inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy 看看我找到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I found, Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Two..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 走 走 不准都看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on. No peeking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,披萨你们这样就算吃完了啊 别浪费啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you guys done with the pizza? I don't want it going to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们快走 - 养女儿可真贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - It's expensive feeding you girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七 八 九 十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight, nine, ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我躲哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where should I hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了没 我来了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready or not, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 拍手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不熟悉这房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know the house well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有人会受伤的 - 我没事 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Someone's gonna get hurt. - I'm okay, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再拍一次手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作弊了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got You!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? -Um.. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 又弄坏啥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, what did we break now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不是有意的 - 出去 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't mean to. - Move out of there, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Christine的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Christine's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上帝啊 - 我的错 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, jeez. - My fault? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Christine干的 - 不是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Christine did it. - No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你推了我 - 不 是你自己往后跌倒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You pushed me. -No, no, you fell back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nancy 能帮我拿些火柴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Nancy, can you go get me the matches, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Nancy打破东西了 - 闭嘴 - 是你干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nancy broke something. - Shut up. - It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么坏了啊 - 墙坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What broke? - It's the Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们有个地窖还是啥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we have a cellar or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 小心 好吧 - 让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna see, I wanna see. - Watch out. Okay. - Move, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 火柴 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, matches. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想看看 - 会看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna see. - You can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想看嘛 - 都看得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wanna see. - You can all see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一时说不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, uh, hard to tell, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一架老式钢琴 一堆垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an old piano and a whole bunch of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.43,0:11:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agh. Son of a..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rog\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rog?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩子别下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you girls going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下面都是蜘蛛 - 恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That place is loaded with spiders. - Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了 Nancy 不好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it, Nancy. It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之多了额外的建筑面积\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got extra square footage anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明早我再看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll check it out in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为啥用木板封住啊 - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wonder why it was boarded up. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们 游戏结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再玩五分钟 - 不能多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five minutes. - No more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上床睡觉 拜托 谢谢配合 - 都去睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up to bed. Please. Thank you. - All right to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 累死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I'm fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sadie怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's up with Sadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 不知道她啥毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I don't know what her problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死活不进门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't get her to come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能留她在外过夜啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't leave her out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没事的 给她上链子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's all right. I got her on a chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sadie 安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadie, hey, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for making this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你割舍了不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it was a lot to bite off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会很棒的 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得已经很好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's great already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是太累 不能给新家来一次洗礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still too fried to christen the new house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说我累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said I'm fried?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没人觉得累 - 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ain't nobody here's fried. - Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得怎样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. How did you guys sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有点凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is chilly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就不能有个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think maybe we could have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫生间能用的房子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bought a house with a toilet that actually works?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你爸爸说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有昨晚我屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was a funky smell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有股恶臭 闻起来像死尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my room last night. Rip like something died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有吗现在 - 没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it still there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题解决了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在下面 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清理这些可得费不少力啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna take some serious elbow grease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些东西怎么处理啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do with all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得仔细翻一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we probably ought to go through it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许会有不少值钱的古董呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There might be some antiques down here worth a lot money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也或许是一堆前主人都不想要的垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, or just a lot of junk the previous owner didn't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在都是我们的了 - 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's ours now. - Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去煮点咖啡 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna make some coffee. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我折腾折腾看这炉子还能用不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna see if I can get this furnace working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了 冻死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that'd be nice. It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sadie 过来 Sadie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadie! Come here, Sadie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈咪 Sadie 在哪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, where's Sadie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在外面呢 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's outside. You know, I'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定饿了 你去找找她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's hungry by now. Why don't you go and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 早 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa. - Morning, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能拿着这个吗 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you hold this? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sadie - 慢点 Scoot\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sadie! - Slow it down, Scoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Roger - 咋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个钟停在3:07 走廊的那个也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This clock stopped at 3:07, and so did the one in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能走着的时候被粗暴对待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it got knocked around in the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到粗暴 昨晚你对我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of knocked around, what did you do to me last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 不是我干的啊 是我吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ouch. I didn't do that. Did I? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sadie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April! April!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 April 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's... April! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 Sadie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Sadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(门罗 康尼狄克州 Warren的房子)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西我们都锁在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep everything locked in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel free to look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你们调查案件里的物件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So all these are taken from cases you've investigated?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每件你看到的 不是闹过鬼 就是被诅咒过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you see in here is either haunted, cursed..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么就是某些仪式中用到的物件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Or has been used in some kind of ritualistic practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是什么玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个玩具猴也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the toy monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这吓人吗 或者说你不担心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, ahem. Well, isn't it scary, or doesn't it worry you..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋里有这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..To have all these items right in your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们每个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we have a priest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都找个牧师来这里赐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that comes by once a month to bless the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the way I see it is:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这些放在这里比在外面更安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's safer for these things to be in here than out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,类似让枪支远离街道的道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of like keeping guns off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为啥不直接把它们丢进焚化炉 毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not just throw them in an incinerator? Destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样破坏的只是容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that would only destroy the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候 把它们封印在瓶子里更好些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes it's better to keep the genie in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 安娜贝拉娃娃也在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, is the, uh, Annabelle doll here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说它只是一个媒介 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said she's a conduit? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个强大的恶魔将自己封于其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very powerful demonic has latched itself onto her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你们调查这些闹鬼事件时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when you guys investigate these hauntings..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.09,0:17:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何避免它们附身在你们身上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..How do you stop them from latching onto you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得提高警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to take great precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你妻子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Gordon神父告诉我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Father Gordon told me that..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在驱魔的时候发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to my wife happened during an exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有何不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:01.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 你干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂事点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know better. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Georgiana\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgiana?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过来 你碰了什么吗 - 没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Did you touch anything? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 过来 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Georgiana 你能带Judy上楼吗 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Georgiana! Could you take Judy upstairs? - Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你都不能进这个房间 记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go into this room, no matter what, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 爸爸 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, Daddy. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 好 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go on. - Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去给你弄点零食吃 好吗 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if I can find you a little snack, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 看我 - 很好看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daddy, look. - You look very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 弄好了 换衣服吃饭去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all done. Go get dressed for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我就穿这个吃饭 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm wearing it to dinner. - No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该会写一篇正面报道吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I think he may write a positive article.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个容易轻信的人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, a non-skeptic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错的改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pleasant change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.01,0:19:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再责怪你自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop blaming yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没放糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了 Nancy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not funny, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别抓我的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop grabbing my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放屁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And stop farting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really stinks.
