Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥 哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.34,0:33:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门那里 他刚才在门后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the door. It was behind the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.92,0:33:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 这儿什么也没有 没人在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, there's nothing in here. There's nobody in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.01,0:33:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有别人在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was someone else in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在睡觉 然后有人在抓我的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just sleeping, and then I felt somebody grab my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.20,0:33:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为是Nancy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I thought it was Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.51,0:33:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我敢肯定只是噩梦而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, honey, I'm pretty sure that it was just a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.20,0:33:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他跟我说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! It talked to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It said..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.15,0:33:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要我们一家人都死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..That it wants my family dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.91,0:33:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Winston先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Winston!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Winston Winston\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winston? Winston?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到他后面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.82,0:33:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.31,0:33:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去商店买点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta run to the store for a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.45,0:34:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想都别想 - 你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why do you even try? - What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.28,0:34:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十五年了 你有骗到过我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 15 years have you ever been able to lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Gordon神父来电话 有个案子想让我们看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Gordon called. He's got a case he wants us to look into.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.60,0:34:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说我自己去看看 Lorraine 就我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'd go check it out myself. Lorraine, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.48,0:34:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.26,0:34:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你担心那件事会重演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're worried it's gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.35,0:34:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我担心 我很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I am. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们该隐退一阵 写本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's just time we take a break. Write that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.41,0:34:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还记得我们结婚那天晚上你对我说的话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember what you said to me on our wedding night?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.55,0:34:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"能再来一次吗"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Can we do it again?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面那句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说上帝让我们走到一起是有原因的 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that God brought us together for a reason. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很确定不是为了写书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pretty sure it's not to write a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.20,0:34:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去换衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.92,0:34:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为问题出在阁楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've isolated the disturbances to the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.23,0:34:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来听听看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to listen for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:34:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 就是这个声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.08,0:34:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次 Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it again, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.23,0:35:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还只是我在施重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now it's just my weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.18,0:35:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当水流经管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you take the water coming off the pipe..
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.83,0:35:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加上风从破掉的窗户吹进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Combined with the wind coming through the broken window..
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.32,0:35:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些木板会胀开并且相互挤压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..These boards are gonna expand and rub against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整栋屋子都能听见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard it all through the house
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.69,0:35:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为这些管子连着暖气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of these pipes leading to the radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.91,0:35:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这屋子没有闹鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this place isn't haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.08,0:35:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 很少是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it rarely is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.92,0:35:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通常都是有科学的解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, there's usually always some kind of rational explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.31,0:35:29.31,3,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.80,0:35:30.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,(Carolyn Perron 一天两次 用于铁质缺乏)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们 早过了上床的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, it's way past your bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.68,0:38:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.64,0:39:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管谁在下面 我要把你锁在里面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's ever down there, I'm gonna lock you in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.04,0:40:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.68,0:40:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Andrea 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrea! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.41,0:40:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 想玩瞎子摸鱼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wanna play hide and clap?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.32,0:41:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.96,0:41:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now..
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.87,0:41:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.03,0:41:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.85,0:41:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚就和我一起睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you can just sleep with me tonight, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.95,0:41:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.71,0:41:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Andrea  - 救命 救命 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Andrea?  - Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.44,0:42:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁在这儿  - Andrea\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's in here?  - Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.91,0:43:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Andrea Andrea\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrea? Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.59,0:43:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 爸爸 救命 是Andrea\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help, Daddy! Help, it's Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.47,0:43:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁在这儿  - Andrea\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's in here?  - Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.40,0:43:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.84,0:43:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊 有人能来告诉我发生了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody, goddamn it, tell me what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.58,0:43:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧 其定义为一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear is defined as a feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.12,0:43:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不安及焦虑的情绪 由已经出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of agitation and anxiety caused by the presence..
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.45,0:43:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.53,0:43:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是将要出现的危险引起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Or imminence of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.21,0:43:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论是鬼魂 灵体 或是某种实体 都以它为食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether it's a ghost, a spirit or an entity, they all feed on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.99,0:43:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如这位Maurice\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Maurice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.12,0:43:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法裔加拿大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A French-Canadian farmer
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.37,0:43:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受教育水平不超过三年级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with no more than a thirdgrade education..
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他被附身以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Yet after he was possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的拉丁语是我听过的最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spoke some of the best Latin I'd ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.95,0:43:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候还能倒着说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.49,0:43:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾被他父亲猥亵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd been molested by his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.19,0:43:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反复虐待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who had also tortured him repeatedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.43,0:43:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个恶灵在这个人身体里安了家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dark spirit made its home in this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.95,0:43:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你看着他的眼睛 你会发现他在泣血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if you look into his eyes, you can see him tearing blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.05,0:43:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like that..
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个倒十字从他的体内浮现出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..An upsidedown cross started to appear from within his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.77,0:44:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Drew 你可以把灯打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Drew, you can hit the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.35,0:44:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有亲自进行过驱魔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you personally perform the exorcism?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.91,0:44:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我没有权力 但我协助参与过许多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not authorized. But I've assisted on many.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.91,0:44:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱魔仪式可能是很危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, an exorcism can be very dangerous..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.84,0:44:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是受害者 每个在屋子里的人都是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Not only for the victim, but for anyone in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.71,0:44:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Maurice怎么了  - 他试图杀死他的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to Maurice?  - He tried to kill his wife..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他射伤了她的手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..But instead shot her in
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.59,0:44:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把枪指向了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the arm and then turned the gun on himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.53,0:44:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Maurice的一生坎坷而无望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maurice had a very troubled life with little to live for..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.60,0:44:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是一位驱魔师也没能救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And not even an exorcist could bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.06,0:44:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们看看魔鬼行为的三个阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which brings us to the three stages of demonic activity:
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.14,0:44:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侵染 压迫 和附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Infestation, oppression and possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.61,0:44:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 侵染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, infestation:
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.74,0:44:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低语声 脚步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the whispering, the footsteps,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.16,0:44:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉到有别人存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the feeling of another presence..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.24,0:44:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后发展为压迫 即第二阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Which ultimately grows into oppression, the second stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.22,0:44:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个阶段 受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is where the victim, and it's usually the one..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.28,0:44:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通常是心理最为脆弱的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Who's the most psychologically vulnerable..
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.39,0:44:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会成为外来力量的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Is targeted specifically by an external force.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.60,0:45:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让受害者崩溃 摧毁他们的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaks the victim down. Crushes their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.19,0:45:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到受害者陷入虚弱的状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, once in a weakened state,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.87,0:45:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会进入第三个阶段 附身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leads them to the third and final stage: possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.56,0:45:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 Ed Lorraine  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Ed? Lorraine?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.50,0:45:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人想和你们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's someone here that would like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.84,0:45:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨  - 谢谢 Drew\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi.  - Thanks, Drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.95,0:45:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you.  - I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.39,0:45:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么能帮到你的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.97,0:45:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家里发生了可怕的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something horrible happening in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能请你们过来看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you come and take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.64,0:45:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间有点晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, uh, it's getting kinda late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.74,0:45:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得回家 - 你不明白状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We really need to head to our family. - No. You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.35,0:45:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明白 一般都有科学的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we do. There's usually some sort of rational explanation..
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.72,0:45:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的五个女儿都快被吓死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have five daughters who are scared to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.59,0:45:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真很怕这东西会伤害我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so afraid this thing wants to hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.05,0:45:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也有一个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.49,0:45:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会竭尽所能地去保护她吗 拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you do anything you could to protect her? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.20,0:45:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们过来看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please can you come and take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.12,0:45:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course,we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.16,0:45:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.68,0:46:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jan 把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jan! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.32,0:46:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jan 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jan, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.05,0:46:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你头上怎么变黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The top of your head turned black.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.62,0:46:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys straighten up? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.73,0:46:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了 这是假发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be silly, it's a wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.53,0:46:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. Hi. - Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.73,0:46:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.20,0:46:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 我是Roger  - 我是Lorraine\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, I'm Roger.  - Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.06,0:46:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 Roger 我是Ed Warren\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, nice to meet you, Roger. Ed Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.88,0:46:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你们能来  - 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for coming.  - Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.96,0:46:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.92,0:46:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So..
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.83,0:46:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 看看你们 这些小美人是谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Look at you all. Who are these beautiful young women?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是Andrea 她是最大的 Nancy Cindy Christine\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Andrea, the oldest, Nancy, Cindy, Christine..
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.72,0:46:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And April.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.07,0:46:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是Warren先生和太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mr. And Mrs. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.10,0:46:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在都睡在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all sleeping down here now. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.12,0:46:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们觉得这样更安全 也更暖和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girls feel safer and it's warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.16,0:46:48.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在把暖气开大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm constantly turning up the heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.36,0:46:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这房子始终冷得要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the house is always freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.89,0:46:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是炉子的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a problem with the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我没有发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, not that I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.44,0:47:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的几夜情况更加糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotten a lot worse the past few nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.84,0:47:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有股奇怪的味道 像是腐烂的肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's this awful smell, like rotting meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.84,0:47:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子里到处都能闻到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It moves around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.98,0:47:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酸臭味有时象征着某种恶魔活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, rancid smells could indicate some type of demonic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.75,0:47:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.60,0:47:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了防止这些门在夜里发出声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's to keep those doors from banging at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.82,0:47:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的话 一整夜都会像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, it's like: All night long, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.72,0:47:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 每次三下吗  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does it come in threes?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.86,0:47:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到天亮结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stops at dawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.74,0:47:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.94,0:47:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是对三位一体的侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sometimes it's meant as an insult to the Trinity:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.19,0:47:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣父 圣子 圣灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Father, the Son and the Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.95,0:47:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最糟糕的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's the damndest thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.74,0:47:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各种各样的鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we also get all kinds of birds..
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.78,0:47:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会撞到房子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..That will just fly against
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.90,0:47:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞断它们的脖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the side of the house and break their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.82,0:47:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.63,0:47:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钟会在凌晨三点零七的时候停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the clocks stop at 3:07 a.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.32,0:48:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全都这样吗  - 所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All of them?  - Every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.75,0:48:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来把这些照片沿楼梯挂着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we were hanging those along the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.80,0:48:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直有什么东西把它们打下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something just kept knocking them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.37,0:48:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们就不挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we stopped hanging them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.58,0:48:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我之前说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们搬进来的时候就在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was here when we moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.95,0:48:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地窖里也有很多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's also a lot of stuff in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.28,0:48:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看地窖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.78,0:48:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她都逼我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what she made me do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.60,0:48:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉到什么了吗 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picking up anything in here, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.40,0:48:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿发生过一些很可怕的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something awful happened here, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.25,0:48:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些淤青是来这里后出现的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those bruises, they from something that happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.47,0:49:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我有些缺铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's some iron deficiency thing I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.73,0:49:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了这么多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, with all that's been going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.24,0:49:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么还没有搬走呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why haven't you just moved out?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.63,0:49:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我们能搬到哪里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where we'd move to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.24,0:49:10.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所有的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got all our money tied up in
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.77,0:49:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都套在这房子上了 修理也费了不少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this place and had a lot of repairs on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.47,0:49:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道谁会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't know anybody whose
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.82,0:49:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收留一家不知会待多久的七口人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gonna take in a family of seven indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.67,0:49:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们找到了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we tracked you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.24,0:49:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很高兴 你们找了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're glad you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.48,0:49:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.86,0:49:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Ed Warren 今天是一九七一年十一月一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Ed Warren. It's November 1st, 1971.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.35,0:49:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我在一起的是Carolyn Perron\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting here with Carolyn Perron..
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.09,0:49:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和她的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Who, with her family,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.90,0:49:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在经历超自然事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been experiencing supernatural occurrences.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.76,0:49:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请讲吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.78,0:49:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从哪儿开始呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.59,0:49:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从最先发生的事开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the first occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.46,0:49:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想应该是那些钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it was the clocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.22,0:49:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸妈告诉我你有个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and Dad tell me that you have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.48,0:49:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的名字叫Rory 他也住在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name's Rory. He lives here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.84,0:49:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 但他总是很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm.  - But he's always sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.74,0:49:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.15,0:49:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不告诉我 但我想他遇到过很不好的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't tell me but I think something bad happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.92,0:50:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能见见Rory吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I try to see Rory?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.10,0:51:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.64,0:52:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是从银行的拍卖会上买来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We bought it at auction from the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.29,0:52:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们一直不知道谁在这儿住过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, you know, we never knew who lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.34,0:52:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lorraine和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Lorraine and I both
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.33,0:52:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为你们的房子需要净化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feel that what your house needs is a cleansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.80,0:52:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.62,0:52:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, exorcism?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.03,0:52:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为那是对人做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was something that you do to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.14,0:52:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 并不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not necessarily, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.21,0:52:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.47,0:52:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕这样做没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that's not gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.70,0:52:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lorraine看见了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine saw something, which..
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.10,0:52:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.88,0:52:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见个邪物萦绕在你们房子周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been seeing the dark entity that haunts your house..
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.19,0:52:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和这块土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And your land.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.54,0:53:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次是进门的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it first when I came through your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.91,0:53:03.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它附在你的身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was latched to your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我又看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I saw it again with
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.07,0:53:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在孩子们身后 在我进客厅的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the girls when we walked into the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.59,0:53:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你们去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it doesn't matter where you go..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.18,0:53:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这邪物已经紧紧地附在了你们一家身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..This dark entity has latched itself to your family..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.35,0:53:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在侵蚀着你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And it's feeding off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.95,0:53:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.52,0:53:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时当你被恶灵缠上 就像是踩到了口香糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes when you get haunted, it's like stepping on gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.47,0:53:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会跟着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.46,0:53:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得告诉你们 你们这儿有很多魂灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I gotta tell you, you have a lot of spirits in here..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这一个我最为担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..But this is the one that I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.25,0:53:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它怨气极重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}most worried about, because it is so hateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办 我们能叫牧师来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what do we do? Can we call a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.15,0:53:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望可以这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish it were that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.63,0:53:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱魔是一种古老的仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Performing an exorcism is an archaic procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.03,0:53:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要多年的训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Requires years of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.72,0:53:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便如此 也会出可怕的差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even then, I have seen it go horribly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.75,0:53:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在那之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But before we even get that far,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.24,0:53:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还必须经由教会的同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the church has to authorize it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.39,0:53:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就意味着我们必须要先调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means we gotta investigate,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.60,0:54:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取证并提供证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gather evidence and provide proof..
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.83,0:54:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是困难的步骤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And that's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.71,0:54:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的孩子洗礼过了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your children been baptized?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.46,0:54:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们不太有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no, we never got around to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.61,0:54:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家并不怎么去教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not really a churchgoing family.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.23,0:54:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你或许要重新考虑下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you may want to rethink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.04,0:54:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的到访可能会让事情更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our presence here could make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.63,0:54:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.09,0:54:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们是威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we're a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.64,0:54:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你们遇到的是啥 肯定不会喜欢我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whatever you're dealing with here isn't gonna like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.82,0:54:23.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前为止它还没有暴力行为 这是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far it hasn't done anything violent, and that's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.48,0:54:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们的人会做些这地方的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're gonna have our guy do some homework on the property..
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.92,0:54:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看看我们对付的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..To see what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.56,0:54:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Judy 什么事儿呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.66,0:54:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有礼物要给你  - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got you a present.  - Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.44,0:54:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和奶奶在教堂的跳蚤市场上买来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Nanna got these at the church's yard sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.73,0:54:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的  - 你一个 我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey.  - One for you and one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.51,0:54:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢  - 她放了一张照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aw.  - She put a picture..
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.23,0:54:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我这个里面 是你和爸爸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Of you and Daddy in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.26,0:54:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶说这样我们就会一直在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nanna said this way we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会和我在一起 我也会和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be with me and I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.75,0:54:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你和爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you and Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.31,0:55:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.11,0:55:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.87,0:55:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 Carolyn的声音没录下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna believe this. Carolyn's voice didn't record.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.16,0:55:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.28,0:55:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.97,0:55:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Ed Warren 今天是一九七一年十一月一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Ed Warren. It's November 1st, 1971.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.39,0:55:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我在一起的是Carolyn Perron\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting here with Carolyn Perron..
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.07,0:55:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和她的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Who, with her family,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正经历超自然现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been experiencing supernatural occurrences.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.32,0:55:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请讲吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.97,0:55:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从最先发生的事开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the first occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.38,0:55:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么也没录下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.39,0:55:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个录音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.50,0:55:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道怎么回事 你发现什么了吗  - 很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. You find anything?  - Lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.86,0:55:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪他们会遇到这样的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's no wonder they're going through what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.08,0:55:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最初的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the original farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.91,0:55:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一八六三年一个叫Jedson Sherman的人盖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was built in 1863 by a man named Jedson Sherman..
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.23,0:55:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他娶了一个叫做Bathsheba的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Who was married to a woman named Bathsheba.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.11,0:55:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 她与Mary Towne Estye有亲属关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, she's related to Mary Towne Estye.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是塞勒姆女巫审判中被指控的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was one of the women accused of witchcraft in Salem.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在游街时被绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was hung during the trials. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.64,0:56:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bathsheba和Jedson结婚后 有了一个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After Bathsheba married Jedson, they had a baby..
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.00,0:56:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在孩子七天大的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..And when the baby was 7 days old..
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.93,0:56:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jedson发现她在壁炉前用孩子做献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Jedson caught her sacrificing it in front of the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.02,0:56:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跑到码头边的树那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ran out to that tree by the dock..
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.17,0:56:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬了上去 宣称她属于撒旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Climbed up, proclaimed her love to Satan..
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.45,0:56:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诅咒了每一个想夺取她土地的人 上吊自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Cursed anyone who tried to take her land, and hung herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.41,0:56:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡时间是凌晨三点零七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time of death was pronounced at 3:07 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.35,0:56:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就说的通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that explains a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.03,0:56:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.87,0:56:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她姓Walker 三十年代时住在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her last name's Walker. She lived there in the '30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.33,0:56:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有个儿子叫Rory\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a boy named Rory
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.44,0:56:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在树林里神秘失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who mysteriously disappeared in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.58,0:56:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而她在地窖里自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she killed herself in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.53,0:56:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.04,0:56:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本两百英亩的农场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what was the original 200-acre
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.75,0:56:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之后被分割并卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}farm has since been subdivided and sold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.91,0:56:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个男孩淹死在了这个池塘里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was another boy who drowned in a pond here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.38,0:56:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他住的房子 在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lived in a house over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.85,0:56:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个在附近的家里当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a woman who worked as a maid
