Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.96,1:03:18.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是九点十八分 我们要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it's 9:18, we're headed down
