Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.54,1:04:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.35,1:05:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我说的 并不是每次都能如愿以偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, like I said, it doesn't always work when you want it to.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.52,1:05:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许摄像机有拍到点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe the camera picked something up.
