Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.94,1:05:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为一个不相信鬼灵的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a guy who doesn't believe..
