Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.24,1:05:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.42,1:05:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等等想带姑娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I might take some girls
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.45,1:05:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去吃冰淇淋 觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for ice cream later on. What do you say about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.83,1:05:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好耶  - 亲爱的 你想来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Honey, you wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.15,1:05:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我累死了 要去睡一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm exhausted. I'm just gonna take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.22,1:05:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熬了几个夜困死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The late nights are getting to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.71,1:06:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意 你去歇歇吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably a good idea. Why don't you get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.95,1:06:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Lorraine和我会照看一切的  - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine and I'll watch over things for a bit. Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.71,1:06:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 一小时我轮班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take off. I have a shift starting in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.79,1:06:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里好久没这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house hasn't felt like this in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.28,1:06:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你们在孩子们好像安心多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the kids feel a lot safer with you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.64,1:06:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能习惯这样  - 什么 我洗衣服吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could get used to this. What, me doing laundry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.14,1:06:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真幽默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hahaha. You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.62,1:06:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我是说这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.57,1:06:26.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乡下新鲜的空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice, fresh country air.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.44,1:06:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有个幸福的家 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have such a beautiful family, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.99,1:06:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最小的那个 April 看见她给我煎饼的样子了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that little one, April, did you see her bring me pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.98,1:06:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须帮他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.31,1:06:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.76,1:06:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从修好雪佛兰开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll start with the Chevy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.48,1:08:13.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.77,1:08:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.75,1:08:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.07,1:08:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 快开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn, open up!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.15,1:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.35,1:08:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事  - 你病了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm fine. Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.79,1:08:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我醒来想吐 仅此而已  - 我好像看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I woke up feeling nauseous, that's all. I thought I saw..
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.79,1:08:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger和孩子们好像回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear Roger and the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.32,1:08:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.51,1:08:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们想玩游戏吗  - 无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, do you wanna play a game? Boring!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.54,1:08:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.42,1:08:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.87,1:08:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.28,1:08:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.80,1:09:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在史密斯菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a good deal on a
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.75,1:09:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,废车场低价买了个组装件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rebuild at that wrecking yard in Smithfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.23,1:09:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不介意 你看上很精通 - 是啊等着看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you look like you know what you're doing. Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.37,1:09:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这儿真不错 Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a nice place here, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.27,1:09:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lorraine和我总想在乡下买个房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine and I always wanted a spot in the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.63,1:09:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这套卖你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sell you this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我递个扳手好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hand me a wrench, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.41,1:09:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们能来对我们来说真是意义重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, it really means a lot to us to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.04,1:09:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认 我之前不太相信这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta admit, I was a little bit skeptical going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.31,1:09:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想跟你道个谢 谢谢你们做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wanna say thank you, though, for coming out when you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.29,1:09:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的功劳 是Lorraine\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take the credit. That's, uh.. That's all Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.08,1:09:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我并不想的  - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to. Oh. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.12,1:09:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lorraine看到的 感受到的 摸到的 帮到了人 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever Lorraine sees, feels, touches, it helps people.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.57,1:09:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但同时也给她带来了伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it also takes a toll on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.15,1:09:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次一点一点侵袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little piece each time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.35,1:09:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个月前我们在着手一个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple months ago we were working on a case.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看到了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She saw something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.94,1:10:13.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次造成了很大的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took a real big piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.28,1:10:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回到家的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we got home..
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.08,1:10:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她进了房间 把自己反锁在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..She went into our room, locked herself in..
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.26,1:10:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不说话 不进食 整整在里面待了八天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..Didn't talk, didn't eat, didn't come out for eight days.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.07,1:10:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd she see?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.58,1:10:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.58,1:10:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.28,1:10:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I won't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.51,1:10:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再去倒点 你要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to reload. You want some?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.16,1:10:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.56,1:10:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.39,1:11:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她都逼我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what she made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.06,1:12:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她都逼我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what she made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.24,1:12:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.00,1:12:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.85,1:12:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看她都逼我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what she made me do!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.56,1:12:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.76,1:12:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.22,1:12:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.88,1:12:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急 Brad 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up, Brad. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.05,1:12:57.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了个人 一个穿着女仆装的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw someone. There was a woman dressed as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.76,1:13:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 有东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed? Ed, we're getting something.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.07,1:13:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是Cindy 她在梦游  - 不 我们需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just Cindy. She's sleepwalking. No, wait. We need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.79,1:13:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要拍Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we need pictures of Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.31,1:13:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是她触发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't trigger it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.24,1:13:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思  - 有东西跟着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean she didn't trigger it? Somebody's with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.68,1:13:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.55,1:13:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.60,1:13:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.93,1:13:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.44,1:13:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 这里安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, over here. It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.31,1:13:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西跟她在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's someone else in there with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.40,1:13:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到其他声音了 给 你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hearing another voice. Here, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.52,1:13:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我走 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.07,1:13:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我躲的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where I hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.71,1:14:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cindy\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cindy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.20,1:14:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去哪了 Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd she go, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.22,1:14:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,窗户锁着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Windows are locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.35,1:14:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 她去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.80,1:14:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Brad 把紫外灯拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad, get the UV light.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.15,1:14:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么东西  - 问Drew\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The what? Just ask Drew.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.59,1:14:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Drew 我需要紫外灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drew, I need a UV light. Uh..
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.48,1:14:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这个 快去快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, that's it. Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.47,1:14:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把灯关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.86,1:14:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别挡着道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.67,1:14:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.02,1:15:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the lights!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.57,1:15:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.72,1:15:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.30,1:15:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱好了吗  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You got her? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.24,1:15:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rory害怕的时候就藏那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where Rory hides when he's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.06,1:16:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 把April的音乐盒给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon? Could I have April's music box, please?
