Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.08,1:29:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她闻起来就像腐肉 也不说怎么了就走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She smells like rotting meat. She didn't say what was going on.She just left.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.67,1:29:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思 她走了 去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, she left? Left where?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.21,1:29:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道她去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone! I don't know where she was going.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.71,1:29:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈 我们要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.15,1:29:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我是Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? It's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.86,1:29:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somethings going on with Carolyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.12,1:29:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Andrea说Carolyn带着Christine和April走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andrea was here, said Carolyn took off with Christine and April.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.11,1:29:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说她闻起来像腐肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girls said she smelled like rotten meat...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.60,1:29:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她附身在母亲身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She possesses the mother..
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.69,1:29:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀孩子 她就是这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..To kill the child, that's what she does.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.83,1:29:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要把他们带去那房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's taking them to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.58,1:29:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger快回去房子那 我和你在那碰面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, get back to the house now. I'll meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.79,1:30:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁上门 拉上窗帘 别接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock the door, close the blinds. Stay off the phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.49,1:30:03.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.16,1:30:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去  - 不 你和Judy待一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming. No, you stay with Judy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.91,1:30:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护Judy唯一的方式就是终结这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only way to protect Judy is if we stop this where it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.26,1:30:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则 她又会缠上我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, she'll latch onto us again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.84,1:30:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly why I am going.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.38,1:30:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我会让你一个人去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm gonna let you walk into this alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.18,1:30:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.12,1:30:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.44,1:30:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起来结束这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's finish this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.00,1:30:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 锁上了 - Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agh! It's locked. Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.15,1:30:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.08,1:30:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.71,1:30:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Roger - Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.67,1:30:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Carolyn  - Ed\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.90,1:31:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Carolyn  - 我们在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn! We're down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.71,1:31:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 别 不不 她有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn, don't! No, no! She's got...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.71,1:31:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住她的手 去拿剪刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her hand! Get the scissors!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.55,1:31:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 得把她弄到车子里去  - 然后带去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get her to the car! And bring her where?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.97,1:31:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她去牧师那驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To take her to the priest for the exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.48,1:31:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- April呢 - April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's April? April?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.65,1:31:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.51,1:31:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把Christine带去车子那 找到April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Christine to the car and find April!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.76,1:31:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.07,1:31:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.67,1:31:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她不会让她离开房子的  - 你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't let her leave the house. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.91,1:31:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们带走她 女巫会杀了她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we take her out, the witch will kill her. Agh!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.10,1:31:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.79,1:32:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.62,1:32:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.52,1:32:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.19,1:32:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你先进去 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm gonna put you in here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.59,1:32:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 进去 待着  - 我不想一个人在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in. Stay in here. I don't wanna stay here by myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.09,1:32:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管发生什么别出来 我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in here no matter what. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得去找April 我会回来的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to find April, okay? I'll be back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.88,1:32:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.87,1:32:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.96,1:32:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.75,1:32:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Brad Brad\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad! Brad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.76,1:32:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿点东西把她绑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get something to tie her up!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.27,1:33:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.56,1:33:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得打给Gordon神父 得让他过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta call Father Gordon. We gotta get Father Gordon out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.07,1:33:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太远了 她撑不住的 看看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's too far away. She won't make it. Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.44,1:33:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得走了  - 你说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you need to leave. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.04,1:33:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来驱魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to do it. The exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.62,1:33:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你不是说要个牧师吗 你又不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I thought you said we need a priest. You're not a priest.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.39,1:33:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还有更好的主意吗  - 他可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you got a better idea? He can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.01,1:33:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以的  - 但你得出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it. But you gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.07,1:33:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不会离开你的  - 该死 Lorraine\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving you! Damn it, Lorraine
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.68,1:33:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not doing this with you in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.87,1:33:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝让我们走到一起是有原因的 此刻就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God brought us together for a reason. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.06,1:33:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去拿书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.24,1:34:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.53,1:34:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.51,1:34:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以圣父 圣子 圣灵之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the name of the Father, the Son, the Holy Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.95,1:35:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.03,1:36:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按住她 按住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold her still! Hold her still!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.11,1:36:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 按住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here! Hold her still!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.92,1:36:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.12,1:36:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.12,1:36:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April 你在下面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April, you under there?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.31,1:36:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.71,1:37:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 不要放弃 不要让她掌控你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn. Carolyn. Don't give in! Don't let her take you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.38,1:37:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 你得停下 你要杀了她了 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed! You gotta stop, you're killing her. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.80,1:37:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.72,1:37:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.65,1:37:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 该死的 快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed! Goddamn it, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.39,1:37:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂 我们是为了她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand this! We are now fighting for her soul!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.99,1:37:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以耶稣 圣人 天使之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the name of Jesus Christ, the saints and all the angels..
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.43,1:37:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你展现你的真面目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I command you to reveal yourself!"
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.91,1:38:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.60,1:38:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放她下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.82,1:38:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放她下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.70,1:38:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放她下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.58,1:39:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.00,1:39:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.06,1:39:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ed 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, look out! Unh!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.59,1:39:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.95,1:39:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按住她 别让她再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold her still! Don't let her up!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.07,1:39:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她快不行了 Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing her, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.05,1:39:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的 离我家人远点 听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you! You leave my family alone, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.35,1:39:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.38,1:39:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你离我妻子远点 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you leave my wife alone, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.15,1:39:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了她 你听到了吗 放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go! Do you hear me? Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.64,1:39:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了她 该死的 放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go, goddamn it! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.52,1:39:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's already gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.31,1:39:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你们也都要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.02,1:39:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,April\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.26,1:39:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到她了 她在房子下面 厨房下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found her! She's under the house! Under the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.43,1:39:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.55,1:40:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.24,1:40:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Carolyn!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.27,1:40:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Carolyn - 她在洞里 就这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn! She's in that hole. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.33,1:40:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 上帝啊 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn? Oh, my God. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.27,1:40:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进不去 够不着啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't go in. Can't reach.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.43,1:40:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 Carolyn 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Carolyn, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.07,1:40:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Carolyn 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carolyn, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.82,1:40:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bathsheba\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bathsheba!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.91,1:40:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上帝赐我之力 我命你重回地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the power of God, I condemn you back to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.50,1:40:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.07,1:40:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能屈服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't give in! Agh!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.91,1:40:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger 我们得让她自己反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger. We need to get her to fight from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.49,1:40:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让她得逞 别让这邪物得逞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let her do this. Don't let this thing do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.84,1:40:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要反抗 我知道你比她强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta fight it. I konw you're stronger than she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.68,1:41:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你得反抗  - 继续 Roger\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta fight! Keep it going, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.24,1:41:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别离开我们 好吗 回来 Carolyn\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta stay with us, all right? Come on back, Carolyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.21,1:41:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错就是这样 把她弄回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in that's it! Get her back!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.43,1:41:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记得你给我看的吗  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what you showed me. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.54,1:41:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得你说过你永远不会忘的那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that day that you said you would never forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.19,1:41:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说他们对你来说就是全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said they meant the world to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.25,1:41:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些你都不要了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you'll be leaving behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.19,1:42:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.80,1:42:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.67,1:42:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.32,1:42:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好爱你 我太爱你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much. I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.80,1:42:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.72,1:42:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.52,1:43:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你这表情 又是风吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A draft do that to your face?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.64,1:43:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿每天面对持枪匪徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd take a guy with a gun any day.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.85,1:43:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did good.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.80,1:43:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.89,1:44:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打给Gordon神父告诉他发生的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call Father Gordon and let him know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.78,1:44:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.60,1:45:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈许可这次驱魔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vatican approved the exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.61,1:45:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来的真是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh. Nice timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.14,1:45:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 他明天想见见我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we can, then he'd like to meet with us tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.16,1:45:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想跟我们聊聊一个在长岛的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a case in Long Island he'd like to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.68,1:45:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.30,1:45:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔的力量是强大的 这些力量永远存在
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.30,1:45:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直至今日 童话是真的 恶魔存在 上帝也存在
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.30,1:45:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对与我们人类来说 命运就取决于我们决意跟随何者
